# Case of the Gorgon's Kiss: "To solve - Three or more creature cards were put into graveyards from anywhere this turn" (CR 719.3a). On turn 3 Bot1 Bolts Bot2's Memnite and Ornithopter (two creature cards into Bot2's
# graveyard) and discards a Memnite to Faithless Looting (a third, into Bot1's): across both graveyards that is three, so the Case solves as the end step begins. "Solved - This Case is a 4/4 Gorgon creature with deathtouch and
# lifelink in addition to its other types" (CR 205.1b, 613.1): it is an enchantment creature Case Gorgon 4/4 with deathtouch and lifelink, and on turn 5 attacking unblocked it deals 4 to Bot2 and Bot1 gains 4. The scenario with only
# two creature cards that turn is the control.

